{"seq":2,"slug":"technician-matching-routing-dispatch","title":"技师技能匹配、地理分区与派单调度机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-installation-assembly-field-service/appointment-technician-dispatch/technician-matching-routing-dispatch","wordCount":2709,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"技师技能匹配-地理分区与派单调度机制\">技师技能匹配、地理分区与派单调度机制</h1><p>一个工单能否在承诺的时间窗内完成，取决于三件事同时成立：接单的技师<strong>会做</strong>、他<strong>到得了</strong>、他在那个时刻<strong>是空的</strong>。预约系统已承诺了「9:00–11:00 上门」（见同章的<a href=\"appointment-slot-capacity-model\">预约时段模型</a>），派单要解决的正是把这个承诺兑现成一条具体可执行的派遣指令。绝大多数安装履约的投诉——迟到、到场做不了、二次上门——溯源下去都停在这三个条件中的某一个被静默放松了。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-派单是三重约束交集上的分配问题\">核心概念：派单是三重约束交集上的分配问题</h2><p>派单（dispatch）在运筹学里的规范名字是<strong>分配问题</strong>（assignment problem）：把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个工单指派给 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 个技师，使总成本最小，且每个工单至多一个技师、每个技师在同一时刻至多一个工单（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Assignment_problem\">Assignment problem</a>）。它的可行域是三个集合的交集——<strong>技能集</strong>（谁能做）、<strong>时空集</strong>（谁在那个时刻那个地点能到）、<strong>资源集</strong>（谁带着需要的工具与备件）。三者之外还有第四类隐形的硬约束：<strong>合规</strong>（电工证、高处作业证是否在有效期内）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[待派工单&lt;br/&gt;地址+SKU+BOM+承诺窗] --&gt; B[需求特征抽取&lt;br/&gt;技能/资质/工具/备件]&#10;  B --&gt; C{候选技师检索}&#10;  C --&gt; D[技能资质过滤&lt;br/&gt;不合格直接剔除]&#10;  C --&gt; E[地理分区过滤&lt;br/&gt;同区优先跨区需审批]&#10;  C --&gt; F[可用性过滤&lt;br/&gt;在班 ∩ 未占时段]&#10;  D --&gt; G[可行候选集]&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H[成本评分&lt;br/&gt;在途+技能冗余+公平]&#10;  H --&gt; I{求解器}&#10;  I --&gt;|即时单| J[贪心匹配]&#10;  I --&gt;|批量| K[VRPTW 元启发式]&#10;  J --&gt; L[派单指令&lt;br/&gt;offer → accept]&#10;  K --&gt; L&#10;  L --&gt; N{异常事件?}&#10;  N --&gt;|请假/缺件/改期| O[增量重排]&#10;  O --&gt; C&#10;  N --&gt;|正常| P[到场执行]\">graph TD\n  A[待派工单&lt;br/&gt;地址+SKU+BOM+承诺窗] --&gt; B[需求特征抽取&lt;br/&gt;技能/资质/工具/备件]\n  B --&gt; C{候选技师检索}\n  C --&gt; D[技能资质过滤&lt;br/&gt;不合格直接剔除]\n  C --&gt; E[地理分区过滤&lt;br/&gt;同区优先跨区需审批]\n  C --&gt; F[可用性过滤&lt;br/&gt;在班 ∩ 未占时段]\n  D --&gt; G[可行候选集]\n  E --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H[成本评分&lt;br/&gt;在途+技能冗余+公平]\n  H --&gt; I{求解器}\n  I --&gt;|即时单| J[贪心匹配]\n  I --&gt;|批量| K[VRPTW 元启发式]\n  J --&gt; L[派单指令&lt;br/&gt;offer → accept]\n  K --&gt; L\n  L --&gt; N{异常事件?}\n  N --&gt;|请假/缺件/改期| O[增量重排]\n  O --&gt; C\n  N --&gt;|正常| P[到场执行]</pre><p>四种过滤的语义不同：技能、资质、时空可用性是<strong>硬约束</strong>，不满足即从候选集删除（在求解器里是&quot;禁止弧&quot;，不进搜索空间）；成本评分是<strong>软约束</strong>，只在可行集内排序。把硬约束写成软惩罚是派单最典型的错误——求解器为省 8 分钟在途会派一个技能差一级的技师，这单随后变成二次上门。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>匹配维度</th>\n<th>硬/软</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n<th>放松后的失效后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>技能等级</td>\n<td>硬</td>\n<td>技能矩阵（技师 × 技能 × 等级）</td>\n<td>到场无法施工，二次上门</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>职业资质</td>\n<td>硬</td>\n<td>证照库（类型/编号/有效期/发证方）</td>\n<td>违规作业，保险拒赔</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时空可用</td>\n<td>硬</td>\n<td>排班日历 ∩ 已占时段 ∩ 在途时间</td>\n<td>超售，承诺窗内不可能到达</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工具随车</td>\n<td>硬</td>\n<td>随车清单 ∩ 工单工具需求</td>\n<td>中途回库取工具，当日产能腰斩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>备件齐套</td>\n<td>硬</td>\n<td>随车库存 ∩ 物料清单 BOM</td>\n<td>缺一个膨胀螺栓就得改期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>地理归属</td>\n<td>软/硬</td>\n<td>服务区域分区</td>\n<td>跨区调度，在途成本失控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>客户指定</td>\n<td>软</td>\n<td>订单偏好</td>\n<td>满意度下降，不阻断履约</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"技能矩阵与资质建模\">技能矩阵与资质建模</h2><p>技能匹配的第一步不是写算法，而是把「这个技师会装壁挂式电视」变成可查询的数据。做法是<strong>技能原子化</strong>：把笼统的工种拆成不可再分的技能原子（<code>tv.wall-mount</code>、<code>ac.split-install</code>、<code>furniture.wardrobe-assembly</code>），每个原子在技师身上带一个等级。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"technician_cert(&#10;  technician_id, skill_id, level 1..5,&#10;  valid_from, valid_to, evidence_url, verified_by&#10;)&#10;work_order_requirement(&#10;  work_order_id, skill_id, min_level, mandatory&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>technician_cert(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  technician_id, skill_id, level 1..5,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  valid_from, valid_to, evidence_url, verified_by</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>work_order_requirement(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  work_order_id, skill_id, min_level, mandatory</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>判定技能是否满足是一条纯函数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>skill_ok</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>j</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>⋀</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></munder><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><mtext>level</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><msub><mtext>min_level</mtext><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><mtext>today</mtext><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>valid_from</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>valid_to</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{skill\\_ok}(j, r) = \\bigwedge_{k \\in K_j} \\mathbb{1}\\big[\\text{level}(r, k) \\ge \\text{min\\_level}_j(k)\\big] \\;\\wedge\\; \\mathbb{1}\\big[\\text{today} \\in [\\text{valid\\_from}, \\text{valid\\_to}]\\big]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">skill_ok</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5494em;vertical-align:-1.4994em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">⋀</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4994em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">level</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3458em;vertical-align:-0.4958em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">min_level</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.102em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3403em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4958em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">today</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">valid_from</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">valid_to</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>式中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是工单 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 的技能原子集合。<strong>有效期判定必须与等级判定放在同一个 AND 里</strong>：高压电工证过期当天，该技师在相关技能上的有效等级立刻归零。跨境场景更麻烦——资质分市场，同一证书在 A 国有效在 B 国不生效，资质库必须带 <code>market</code> 维度。</p>\n<p>等级不是&quot;熟练度分数&quot;而是<strong>可派单的授权</strong>：1 级=需带教、2 级=可独立做标准品、3 级=可做复杂品、4 级=可做异常与返工、5 级=可带教与质检。3 级技师做 2 级工单是<strong>技能向下兼容</strong>，浪费但可行；2 级去做需要 3 级的工单是<strong>向上越权</strong>，必须禁止。这让等级序成为偏序约束，决定可行集大小。</p>\n<h2 id=\"地理分区与到程时间矩阵\">地理分区与到程时间矩阵</h2><p>「技师离得近不近」不能靠经纬度直线距离估——隔一条河的直线 2 公里，绕行可能 12 公里。派单的成本输入必须是<strong>到程时间矩阵</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（上一站 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 到当前站 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 的预估行驶时间），由路由引擎生成：开源侧 OSRM（<a href=\"https://project-osrm.org/\">Project OSRM</a>）与 Valhalla（<a href=\"https://valhalla.github.io/valhalla/\">Valhalla</a>），商业侧 Google 路径优化 API 直接提供时间矩阵（<a href=\"https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/route-optimization/overview\">Route Optimization API</a>）。分区（territory）把连续空间离散成<strong>运营单元</strong>，把&quot;全域搜索&quot;降为&quot;邻域搜索&quot;，给运营一个可管理的责任边界：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分区方案</th>\n<th>结构</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>行政区（邮编/街道/城市）</td>\n<td>不规则多边形</td>\n<td>与地址、税费、合规天然对齐</td>\n<td>大小悬殊，市中心一个区顶郊县十个</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>地理网格 geohash</td>\n<td>矩形递归、Z 序</td>\n<td>字符串前缀即邻近，索引简单（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Geohash\">Geohash</a>）</td>\n<td>Z 序有&quot;边界跳变&quot;，相邻格子前缀可能不同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>六边形层级 H3</td>\n<td>六边形递归、19 个分辨率</td>\n<td>六邻接等距，无方向偏差（<a href=\"https://h3geo.org/\">H3</a>）</td>\n<td>与行政区不对齐，需额外映射</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>H3 的价值在于分辨率可选：分辨率 7 的单元平均面积约 5 平方公里、边长约 1.4 公里，适合城市内分区；分辨率 9 平均面积约 0.1 平方公里、边长约 200 米，适合楼宇级聚合（见 <a href=\"https://h3geo.org/docs/core-library/restable\">H3 官方分辨率表</a>）。跨境复杂点在<strong>分区口径要在市场间统一</strong>：东南亚三线城市的分辨率 7 单元可能超过技师一小时的骑行圈，而在东京同等单元里塞得下十几个技师，所以<strong>分辨率应由&quot;人均可服务面积&quot;分市场标定</strong>。分区之外还要显式建模<strong>跨区支援</strong>：某区技师全占用而邻区空闲时，允许跨区能提升利用率但要付在途代价，工程上做成带系数的软约束——同区 1.0、邻区 1.3、跨两区 1.8，超过阈值才需人工审批。</p>\n<h2 id=\"派单求解-匹配算法与批量调度\">派单求解：匹配算法与批量调度</h2><p>派单在计算上有两个形态，用错形态是性能事故的常见来源。<strong>即时派单（单工单到达）<strong>是在线二分匹配：候选集通常只有几十个，用</strong>贪心 + 优先队列</strong>就是生产级答案——按成本升序扫描可行候选，取第一个未被占用且能按时到达的技师，复杂度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n \\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，规模小、稳定、可解释，运营能复现&quot;为什么派给了他&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>批量派单（一夜重排）<strong>才是真正的组合优化。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 个工单与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个技师同时给定、求总成本最小，用</strong>匈牙利算法</strong>（Kuhn–Munkres）可在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^3)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 内求最小成本完美匹配（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hungarian_algorithm\">Hungarian algorithm</a>）。一旦把&quot;一个技师一天跑多单、且要考虑顺序与时间窗&quot;纳入，问题升级为带时间窗的车辆路径问题 VRPTW，属 NP-hard（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vehicle_routing_problem\">Vehicle routing problem</a>），必须靠元启发式近似——OR-Tools 的路由库把这类问题建模为&quot;节点 + 时间维度 + 容量维度&quot;并用引导式局部搜索逼近（<a href=\"https://developers.google.com/optimization/routing\">OR-Tools Routing</a>）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>规模</th>\n<th>推荐算法</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>即时单派单</td>\n<td>单工单 × 数十候选</td>\n<td>贪心 + 优先队列</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>双边偏好匹配</td>\n<td>数十 × 数十</td>\n<td>Gale–Shapley 延迟接受（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stable_marriage_problem\">Stable marriage</a>）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一次性批量配对</td>\n<td>数百 × 数百</td>\n<td>匈牙利 / 最小成本流</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^3)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>整日路线排班</td>\n<td>数百到数千节点</td>\n<td>VRPTW 元启发式</td>\n<td>近似</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分布式竞价</td>\n<td>大规模松耦合</td>\n<td>拍卖算法（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Auction_algorithm\">Auction algorithm</a>）</td>\n<td>近似</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>成本函数的加权设计决定派单的&quot;性格&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>cost</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>j</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>t</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>level</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>min_level</mtext><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>load</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>跨区</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{cost}(j, r) = w_t \\cdot \\frac{t_{jr}}{\\bar t} + w_s \\cdot (\\text{level}(r) - \\text{min\\_level}_j) + w_f \\cdot \\text{load}(r) + w_c \\cdot \\mathbb{1}[\\text{跨区}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cost</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.9781em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2921em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1841em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">level</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2458em;vertical-align:-0.4958em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">min_level</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.102em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3403em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4958em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7306em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">load</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">跨区</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 越大越省在途，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 越大越倾向高技能技师，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是负载均衡项（防止明星技师被榨干），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 压跨区。<strong>这套权重是运营旋钮而不是算法常量</strong>——旺季调大 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 追求吞吐，投诉高时调大 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 追求一次做对。</p>\n<h2 id=\"派单执行与在线重排\">派单执行与在线重排</h2><p>派出去不等于完成。调度单要有明确且<strong>每次迁移幂等</strong>的状态机：<code>created → offered → accepted → en_route → on_site → completed</code>，任一环节超时或撤销都能回滚到可重派的状态。</p>\n<p>在线扰动是常态：技师请假、备件调拨失败、客户改期、上一单超时。工程上要在两个极端间取平衡——<strong>全局重算</strong>（每夜重解，质量高但无法应对日内扰动）与<strong>增量修复</strong>（只做插入、交换、邻域搜索，快但可能陷局部最优）。成熟做法是分层：夜批解生成基线下发，日内只做局部修复，且<strong>修复不得静默改变已承诺给客户的到达窗</strong>——要改必须走通知流程，这正是预约时把&quot;承诺窗&quot;与&quot;内部解窗&quot;分开的价值。</p>\n<p>派单还有隐性代价：<strong>稳定性代价</strong>。频繁重排会让技师对当日路线失去预期。可在目标函数里加&quot;路线扰动惩罚&quot; <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>churn</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msup><mtext>assign</mtext><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mtext>assign</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{churn} = \\sum_{j,r} \\mathbb{1}[\\text{assign}&#x27;(j) \\ne \\text{assign}(j)]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">churn</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2455em;vertical-align:-0.4358em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">assign</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8097em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1208em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">assign</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span></span></span></span></span>，只有当&quot;重排收益 &gt; 稳定性代价 + 通知成本&quot;时才执行——把运营经验写成显式阈值。</p>\n<p>验收指标要反向证明机制有效：<strong>首次修复率</strong>（FTF）、<strong>准时到达率</strong>（OTA）、<strong>平均派遣距离</strong>、<strong>技师承接率</strong>、<strong>跨区比率</strong>。前两个是结果指标，后三个是过程指标——结果恶化时，过程指标告诉你是不是分区分辨率或权重出了问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>派单是分配问题</strong>：在技能、时空、资源三重硬约束的交集上，对软约束（在途、技能冗余、公平、成本）求最小。硬约束写成软惩罚是二次上门的头号根因。</li>\n<li><strong>技能要原子化并带等级与有效期</strong>，资质与等级判定放在同一个 AND 里；跨境资质库必须带 <code>market</code> 维度；<strong>等级是偏序而非分数</strong>——向下兼容可行、向上越权禁止。</li>\n<li><strong>地理成本用时间矩阵不用直线距离</strong>；分区用 geohash/H3/行政区的组合，分辨率按&quot;人均可服务面积&quot;分市场标定，跨区做成带系数的软约束。</li>\n<li><strong>算法按形态选</strong>：即时单用贪心，批量配对用匈牙利 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^3)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，整日路线用 VRPTW 元启发式，双边偏好用稳定匹配。</li>\n<li><strong>成本权重是运营旋钮</strong>（旺季重吞吐、投诉高时重一次做对）；<strong>在线扰动靠分层重排</strong>——夜批解为基线、日内做增量修复，不静默改变已承诺的到达窗，并计入稳定性代价。</li>\n<li>用 <strong>FTF、OTA、派遣距离、跨区比率</strong>交叉验证机制健康度。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>延伸阅读：工单的商品化与计价规则见 <a href=\"../installation-service-catalog/\">第 1 章 安装服务商品与规则</a>，承诺窗与容量建模见同章<a href=\"appointment-slot-capacity-model\">预约时段模型</a>，到场执行与交付见 <a href=\"../field-execution-delivery/\">第 3 章 现场执行</a>，完工验收与售后见 <a href=\"../completion-aftersales/\">第 4 章 完工与售后</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"技师技能匹配、地理分区与派单调度机制","id":"技师技能匹配-地理分区与派单调度机制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：派单是三重约束交集上的分配问题","id":"核心概念-派单是三重约束交集上的分配问题"},{"level":2,"text":"技能矩阵与资质建模","id":"技能矩阵与资质建模"},{"level":2,"text":"地理分区与到程时间矩阵","id":"地理分区与到程时间矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"派单求解：匹配算法与批量调度","id":"派单求解-匹配算法与批量调度"},{"level":2,"text":"派单执行与在线重排","id":"派单执行与在线重排"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"预约时段模型：时间窗、容量与多资源约束","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-installation-assembly-field-service/appointment-technician-dispatch/appointment-slot-capacity-model"},"next":{"title":"改约取消、爽约与候补重派异常处置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-installation-assembly-field-service/appointment-technician-dispatch/reschedule-noshow-candidate-queue"}}